{"id": 1005453, "slug": "castle-crumble", "name": "Castle Crumble", "name_original": "Castle Crumble", "description": "<p>Embark on an adventure and conquer mighty kingdoms!</p><p>In Castle Crumble, your goal is clear—castles must fall. Fulfill the dream of reducing towering fortresses to dust in a fully simulated physics environment. Could destruction be relaxing? In Castle Crumble it can!</p><h3>Key Features:</h3><p>Utilize a variety of tools to bring down castles in different ways. For even greater firepower, equip boosters and unleash true destruction!</p><p>Every move counts. Use your limited ammo wisely, set up chain reactions, and watch as multi-staged castles crumble before your eyes.</p><p>Each brick and wooden beam is individually simulated, allowing for dynamic and unpredictable destruction. Knock towers onto other buildings or trigger placed explosives with flying rubble for spectacular results.</p><p>Explore the world of Castle Crumble, featuring unique and beautiful landscapes. From dense jungles to scorching deserts and serene coastal islands, each kingdom offers new challenges to overcome.</p><p>Prepare to strategize, demolish, and conquer in Castle Crumble—where every collapse is a victory!</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-06-19", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-06-23T09:16:13", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/024/02469ba4e41bf4b9b5a16ac3d48ed36c.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/c13/c1386b298951f619eb95f2908d6bd4ba.jpg", "website": "https://www.orbitalknight.com/games/castle-crumble", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 0, "added_by_status": null, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 8, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "twitch_count": 0, "y